WEBVTT - Saltmere Harbour
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

NOTE Written for whiff's tests.

STYLE
::cue(v[voice="Ana"]) { color: yellow }

REGION
id:bottom width:80% lines:3 regionanchor:0%,100% viewportanchor:10%,90%

cue-1
00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000 region:bottom align:center
<v Ana>Morning on the Saltmere breakwater.

00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
<v Ana>The ferry leaves at seven,
as it has for forty years.

00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:10% position:50%
[gulls calling]

cue-4
00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.000
<v Ben>Tide's turning. We should check
the mooring buoys.

00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.000
<v.loud Ana><i>The lighthouse keeper logs
every boat that passes.</i>

00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.500 line:10% position:50%
♪ brass band playing ♪

cue-7
00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.500
<v Ben>Harbour office, this is the pilot launch.

00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Ana>Fog rolls in from the outer mole by noon.

00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.000
<v Ben>Keep to the marked channel
past the red buoy.

cue-10
00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.000
<v Ana>By evening the quay is quiet again.
